<HR><A NAME="owners_manual"><B><FONT COLOR="#3366ff">Does anyone know where an owners manuals can be obtained?
</FONT></B></A><BR><BR>
When <A HREF="../owners/nigel_gladstone.html">Nigel Gladstone</A>
brought his second hand Tipo 16V it did not have an owners manual. Does
anyone know where he can find one?  Nigel contacted FIAT who stated that
there was only one manual produced which covered all
models. My manual certainly covers all models but Nigel says that the manual
he has found does not cover the 2.0 16V. This could possibly be because the 2.0 16V
was produced at a later date than the first range of models.
Calvin Jones
says that there was an additional short manual which covered
relevant extra bits for the 2.0 16v, 1.8 16v and 1.9Tds.

