</FONT></B></A><BR><BR>
Mike Jukes
would like to know how many Tipo 16V cars were sold in the UK. I
read in &quot;Fast Car&quot magazine who had an article/advertisement on/for
Cann Durrant that 600 were imported into the UK. I don't know if this was
both 5 and 3 door or only the 5 door. Does anyone have any offical figures?

<HR><A NAME="scale"><B><FONT COLOR="#3366ff">Does anyone know if there are any scale models of the Tipo?
</FONT></B></A><BR><BR>
<A HREF="../owners/pedro_baioes.html">Pedro Baioes</A>
would like to know if there are any scale models of the Fiat Tipo?
Pedro has 1 1/24 from Burago but would like a larger scale model to turn
